@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Upload Multimodal Data
top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8C6
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 12
}

note top
Steps:
1) Open upload screen
2) Select file(s) + optional tags
3) Validate type/size/safety
4) If invalid, show validation error
5) Store DataAsset + metadata
6) Create ProcessingContext + queue processing
7) Show Upload successful
end note

(*) --> "1. Open Upload screen"
--> "2. Select file(s)\n+ optional tags"
--> "3. Validate type/size/safety"

if (Valid?) then (Yes)
  --> "5. Store DataAsset\n+ metadata"
  --> "6. Create ProcessingContext\n+ queue processing"
  --> "7. Show Upload successful"
  --> (*)
else
  --> "4. Show validation error"
  --> (*)
endif

@enduml